      ],
      "text": "8. Evidence for recommendations on",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 22.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.26490020751953,
        79.98431396484375,
        356.2488708496094,
        106.36231231689453
      ],
      "text": "treatment of fever conditions",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 22.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.5670166015625,
        334.7840881347656,
        203.75601196289062
      ],
      "text": "8.1\t Antibiotics for treatment of acute bacterial meningitis",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        207.19261169433594,
        399.1026306152344,
        220.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "a)\t Children with acute bacterial meningitis should be treated empirically with 3rd",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        220.19261169433594,
        177.3615264892578,
        233.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "generation cephalosporins.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        233.19261169433594,
        399.0114440917969,
        246.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "—\t Ceftriaxone: 50mg/kg per dose IV every 12 hours, or 100 mg/kg once daily, or",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        246.19261169433594,
        307.0615234375,
        259.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "—\t Cefotaxime: 50mg/kg per dose 6 hourly for 10–14 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        261.5972900390625,
        287.83294677734375,
        275.5173034667969
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate quality of evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        277.86187744140625,
        399.0528869628906,
        291.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "b)\tWhere it is known that there is no significant resistance to chloramphenicol",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        290.86187744140625,
        399.05145263671875,
        304.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "and beta lactam antibiotics among bacteria-causing meningitis, follow national",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        303.86187744140625,
        293.25152587890625,
        317.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "guidelines or choose any of the following two regimens:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        316.86187744140625,
        396.7713928222656,
        330.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "—\t Chloramphenicol: 25 mg/kg IM (or IV) every 6 hours plus ampicillin: 50 mg/",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.20469665527344,
        329.86187744140625,
        196.26473999023438,
        343.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "kg IM (or IV) every 6 hours.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        342.86187744140625,
        81.58150482177734,
        356.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "OR",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        355.86187744140625,
        399.1203918457031,
        369.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "—\t Chloramphenicol: 25 mg/kg IM (or IV) every 6 hours plus benzyl penicillin:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.20469665527344,
        368.86187744140625,
        303.3446960449219,
        382.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "60 mg/kg (100 000 units/kg) every 6 hours IM (or IV).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        384.2665100097656,
        301.0027770996094,
        398.1865234375
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, moderate quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        400.53118896484375,
        399.03289794921875,
        414.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "The panel noted that, based on data from developed countries, most international",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        413.53118896484375,
        396.8504943847656,
        427.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "guide­lines recommended treatment for at least 10 days for bacterial meningitis pa­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        426.53118896484375,
        396.8504943847656,
        440.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "tients with no adverse or poor prognostic factors. However, data from recent multi­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        439.53118896484375,
        399.11285400390625,
        453.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "centre study conducted in five developing countries showed that in children beyond",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        452.4012145996094,
        399.1203918457031,
        466.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "Staphylococcus pneumoniae the neonatal age with purulent meningitis caused by  ,",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        465.4012145996094,
        399.0941162109375,
        479.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "Haemophilus influenzae Nesiria meningitidis , Type b, or   who are stable by day 5",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        478.53118896484375,
        399.0728759765625,
        492.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "of ceftriaxone treatment, could safely discontinue antibiotics. However, the panel",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        491.53118896484375,
        399.102783203125,
        505.0212097167969
      ],
      "text": "choose to adopt the more conservative approach pending further evidence of the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        504.53118896484375,
        217.35296630859375,
        518.0211791992188
      ],
      "text": "safety of shortened duration treatment.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        517.5311889648438,
        399.1114807128906,
        531.0211791992188
      ],
      "text": "The panel also raised concern about the possibility of overuse of ceftriaxone if",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        530.5311889648438,
        399.1127624511719,
        544.0211791992188
      ],
      "text": "there is a loose definition of “suspected meningitis”, hence the need for promoting",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        543.5311889648438,
        383.8028869628906,
        557.0211791992188
      ],
      "text": "use of a lumbar puncture in suspected meningitis before commencing treatment.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        556.5311889648438,
        399.1313781738281,
        570.0211791992188
      ],
      "text": "It was also noted that the use of steroids is not effective in developing countries",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        569.5311889648438,
        200.0529327392578,
        583.0211791992188
      ],
      "text": "most likely due to late presentation.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.43350219726562,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.60549926757812,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "52",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}